      "content": "hey, i had a weird thing happen just now. i went to stand up from the couch and everything just went black for a second, like i passed out but then i was right back. i'm 72 and i've been feeling a bit worn out lately. i think i might just be dehydrated or something, should i just drink some extra water and take a nap or is it something worse?",
