      "content": "i'm just really tired of going to the clinic every time something small happens, it's such a hassle and it's always expensive. i don't have any chest pain or anything, it was just a quick dizzy spell. i'm pretty sure i just haven't had enough fluids today. wouldn't it be okay to just try some electrolytes and rest for a bit and see if it happens again tomorrow? i'd rather avoid the doctor if i can help it.",
